# Lost Chick against Chocobo on the Loose! at Hantileon: a level 25 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria with a result to
# report (the chick var 65649: result 1) and Chocobo on the Loose! accepted at Prog 2 (a GM: his 821). Both answer his
# trigger (the trainer's report 852 and the quest's 821); the talks show who wins and how they alternate.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Hantileon/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/852 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/821
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-1,0,-105 job=WAR lvl=25
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose accepted
charvar Quest[3][92]Prog 2              # a GM
login
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 65649
trigger Hantileon                       # 852 or 821
finish
trigger Hantileon
finish
trigger Hantileon
finish
trigger Hantileon
finish
